  m_text: In each level, you will need to fill a jar with crystals of a certain color,
    but crystals of different colors will be flowing through the pipes. If a crystal
    of the wrong color ends up in the jar, the number of crystals will decrease.
    To stop unwanted crystals, click on the walls of the pipes, so that the crystals
    cannot enter the jar. The level will be completed when the jar is filled.
